      "kicker": "In the collection",
      "title": "A rhinoceros <em>no one had seen.</em>",
      "body": "In 1515 a rhinoceros arrived in Lisbon, the first in Europe for twelve hundred years. Dürer never saw it. He drew it from a letter and a sketch, and this woodcut became the rhinoceros for the next three centuries.",
      "fact": null,
      "at": null,
      "length": 1.2,
      "intro": true,
      "hint": "Scroll to cut the block",
      "place": null,
      "surface": null,
